This product is an independent implementation for DeepSeek Harness. It was
designed with reference to the publicly documented design of nanoMuse
(https://github.com/nano-muse/nanoMuse, GPL-3.0-or-later), in particular:

  docs/design.md     — what a personal agent is: name, face, memory, reach
  docs/sentinel.md   — risk levels, decision order, capabilities, taint,
                       approval scopes, audit
  docs/memory.md     — memory as Markdown files a person can read and edit

No nanoMuse source code was copied into this repository. The concepts above
were reimplemented against DeepSeek Harness' own plugin APIs (defineTool,
ctx.systemPrompt, tools/pre-execute, ctx.approval, ctx.slots). DS Muse is
therefore licensed MIT and not as a derivative work of nanoMuse's GPL code.

If you believe any file here is derived from GPL-licensed source, please open
an issue so it can be removed or the licence corrected.

The agent preset in presets/dsmuse.patch.yml is adapted from the plugin list in
`@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app/presets/standard.patch.yml` (MIT, DeepSeek Harness).
It is configuration, reproduced with attribution so Muse sessions have the same
capabilities as a standard session.

